GROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">서울시 마포구 마포대로 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">122)</span></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">지하설 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">5·6</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">호선 공덕역 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">번 출구 인근</span></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">참가기업 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">약 </span><span style=